{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >problem Fixing</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If your Windows system cannot run the game properly, you can run wushowhide-1.diagcab included in the zip file to fix it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Selection Interface</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click the button to dress up your mascot with a variety of available outfits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859870/extras/fde03f435a10ad445e6b6352caf73fed.poster.avif?t=1771253910\" width=450 height=742 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859870/extras/fde03f435a10ad445e6b6352caf73fed.webm?t=1771253910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859870/extras/fde03f435a10ad445e6b6352caf73fed.mp4?t=1771253910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Touch your mascot to interact! There are many different reactions to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859870/extras/15d961981a4590564e75df519c111ad6.poster.avif?t=1771253910\" width=450 height=742 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859870/extras/15d961981a4590564e75df519c111ad6.webm?t=1771253910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859870/extras/15d961981a4590564e75df519c111ad6.mp4?t=1771253910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859870/extras/23e619b39a93b106661da8a091f853f0.avif?t=1771253910\" width=216 height=482 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click the button to select the mode, There are story mode, vs mode, counter mode available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click on the arrow to switch between fighters, allowing you to view the fighter\u2019s appearance, name, and skill settings. Each fighter has two exclusive skills and one universal skill for blocking. There are a total of 110 fighters available to use. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(PLAYER1 can switch fighters by pressing the AD keys, while PLAYER2 can switch fighters by pressing the left and right keys.)  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click on the arrow to switch between with and without props. There are a total of 110 props available to use. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(PLAYER1 can switch between with and without items by pressing the J key, while PLAYER2 can switch between with and without items by pressing NumPad 1.) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click on the arrow to switch between PLAYER and COMPUTER, allowing you to play against a computer or watch a computer play against another computer(Cyber Beast-fighting). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(PLAYER1 can switch between a real person and a computer by pressing the WS keys, while PLAYER2 can switch between a real person and a computer by pressing the up and down keys.) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click on the arrow to switch between BO(best of x), from BO1 to BO21. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(PLAYER1 can switch between BO by pressing the KL keys, while PLAYER2 can switch between BO by pressing NumPad 2 and NumPad 3.) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click on the arrow to switch between full tutorial, only item tutorial, and no tutorial.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Control Instructions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PLAYER1</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move\uff1aWASD</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill\uff1aJK</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Def\uff1aL</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Item\uff1a;(Semicolon)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PLAYER2</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move\uff1a\u2191\u2193\u2190\u2192(Directional keys)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill\uff1aNumPad 12</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Def\uff1aNumPad 3</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Item\uff1aNumPad Enter</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some skills have a CD (Cooldown) time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many skills can be cast while moving with the directional keys to adjust the position of the spell cast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flexible positioning, masterful use of skills, and skillful blocking are key to overcoming enemies.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2859870?t=1771253910","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859870/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771253910","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859870/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771253910","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859870/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771253910","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >problem Fixing</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If your Windows system cannot run the game properly, you can run wushowhide-1.diagcab included in the zip file to fix it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Selection Interface</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click the button to dress up your mascot with a variety of available outfits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859870/extras/fde03f435a10ad445e6b6352caf73fed.poster.avif?t=1771253910\" width=450 height=742 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859870/extras/fde03f435a10ad445e6b6352caf73fed.webm?t=1771253910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859870/extras/fde03f435a10ad445e6b6352caf73fed.mp4?t=1771253910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Touch your mascot to interact! There are many different reactions to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859870/extras/15d961981a4590564e75df519c111ad6.poster.avif?t=1771253910\" width=450 height=742 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859870/extras/15d961981a4590564e75df519c111ad6.webm?t=1771253910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859870/extras/15d961981a4590564e75df519c111ad6.mp4?t=1771253910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859870/extras/23e619b39a93b106661da8a091f853f0.avif?t=1771253910\" width=216 height=482 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click the button to select the mode, There are story mode, vs mode, counter mode available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click on the arrow to switch between fighters, allowing you to view the fighter\u2019s appearance, name, and skill settings. Each fighter has two exclusive skills and one universal skill for blocking. There are a total of 110 fighters available to use. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(PLAYER1 can switch fighters by pressing the AD keys, while PLAYER2 can switch fighters by pressing the left and right keys.)  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click on the arrow to switch between with and without props. There are a total of 110 props available to use. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(PLAYER1 can switch between with and without items by pressing the J key, while PLAYER2 can switch between with and without items by pressing NumPad 1.) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click on the arrow to switch between PLAYER and COMPUTER, allowing you to play against a computer or watch a computer play against another computer(Cyber Beast-fighting). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(PLAYER1 can switch between a real person and a computer by pressing the WS keys, while PLAYER2 can switch between a real person and a computer by pressing the up and down keys.) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click on the arrow to switch between BO(best of x), from BO1 to BO21. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(PLAYER1 can switch between BO by pressing the KL keys, while PLAYER2 can switch between BO by pressing NumPad 2 and NumPad 3.) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click on the arrow to switch between full tutorial, only item tutorial, and no tutorial.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Control Instructions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PLAYER1</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move\uff1aWASD</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill\uff1aJK</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Def\uff1aL</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Item\uff1a;(Semicolon)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PLAYER2</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move\uff1a\u2191\u2193\u2190\u2192(Directional keys)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill\uff1aNumPad 12</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Def\uff1aNumPad 3</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Item\uff1aNumPad Enter</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some skills have a CD (Cooldown) time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many skills can be cast while moving with the directional keys to adjust the position of the spell cast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flexible positioning, masterful use of skills, and skillful blocking are key to overcoming enemies.</p>","developers":["\u7406\u5de5\u4e92\u52a9\u4f1a"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859870/header.jpg?t=1771253910","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2859870/1514616374/8a123157f46d1bbd168d55f5f643c84de6e50873/1771223739/dash_av1.mpd?t=1771224150","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2859870/1514616374/8a123157f46d1bbd168d55f5f643c84de6e50873/1771223739/dash_h264.mpd?t=1771224150","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2859870/1514616374/8a123157f46d1bbd168d55f5f643c84de6e50873/1771223739/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1771224150","id":257214927,"name":"2nd","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257214927/c01760f1a93da460293c89aa94a93607b962d292/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1771224150"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2859870/1326609147/53def075ecceb7de0138194eb86c4d15146e79e2/1771253449/dash_av1.mpd?t=1771253909","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2859870/1326609147/53def075ecceb7de0138194eb86c4d15146e79e2/1771253449/dash_h264.mpd?t=1771253909","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2859870/1326609147/53def075ecceb7de0138194eb86c4d15146e79e2/1771253449/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1771253909","id":257045853,"name":"1st","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257045853/779818d4e78b66436a18af182ee4db96aeb68890/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1771253909"}],"name":"Duel of games","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> <br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> <br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> <br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 MB 